6. Recommendations

Always use parameterised queries — never concatenate SQL strings.
Never use | safe with user-supplied input in Jinja2.
Store secrets in environment variables or a secrets manager (e.g., HashiCorp Vault).
Enforce NIST SP 800-63B password guidelines (min 8 chars recommended; project uses 10+).
Never pass user input to shell=True subprocesses; prefer shell=False + allow-list.
